# DRAW keymap preset: MS Paint  (SAFEST — only DRAW-free target keys remapped)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt.  Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# Policy (Rick, "safest"): applied ONLY if the target key is UNBOUND in DRAW.
#
# MS Paint uses very few tool letters (it favours the ribbon + Ctrl combos). Its Ctrl
# shortcuts mostly match DRAW already (Ctrl+Z/Y/A/C/V/X/S/O/N/P). Little to remap.

# --- Safe remaps (target key free in DRAW: Ctrl+I/J/K/U/W) ---
# MS Paint has no distinctive free-key op DRAW mirrors 1:1. (none)

# --- COLLISIONS / matches (documented) ---------------------------------------
#   Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y   Undo / Redo   -> DRAW matches
#   Ctrl+A            Select All     -> DRAW matches
#   Ctrl+C/V/X        Copy/Paste/Cut -> DRAW matches
#   Ctrl+E            Image props    -> DRAW Ctrl+E is Merge-down (collision)
#   Ctrl+W            Resize/Skew    -> DRAW Ctrl+W is FREE — could map if DRAW gains a
#                                       resize-canvas action id (none bound today)
#   Ctrl+G            Gridlines      -> DRAW Ctrl+G is New Group (collision)
#   Ctrl+PgUp/PgDn    Zoom           -> DRAW Ctrl+PgUp/PgDn are bound (collision)
